{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Provider of space semantic tokens to use for quantity input component","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider\/spaces","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"spaces"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllSpaceSemanticTokensProviderP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","text":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemequantityinputcomponenttokensprovider\/spaces"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"spaces","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B41ThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProviderC6spaces0A8Contract016AllSpaceSemanticgH0_pvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"spaces"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllSpaceSemanticTokensProviderP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"}],"symbolKind":"property"},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider":{"title":"OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemequantityinputcomponenttokensprovider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of quantity input"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"code":"OUDSQuantityInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"code":"AllQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"code":"QuantityInputComponentTokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tag inputs"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Quantity inputs"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and spaces (from "},{"code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider":{"title":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/allspacesemantictokensprovider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Something which provides all semantic tokens of space"}],"kind":"symbol"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","title":"Theme Orange","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider/spaces":{"title":"spaces","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemequantityinputcomponenttokensprovider\/spaces","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider\/spaces","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spaces","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllSpaceSemanticTokensProviderP"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of space semantic tokens to use for quantity input component"}],"kind":"symbol"}}}